# Dependencies & Build artifacts
node_modules
.next
out
dist
build
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# Environment files
# Keep these OUT of the build context. Next.js still gets the real values during
# `npm run build` because docker-compose.yml mounts .env as a BuildKit secret at
# /app/.env for that step -- secrets are read from the host, not the context, so
# ignoring them here does not affect the build.
#
# Runtime values are supplied separately by `env_file` in docker-compose.yml.
.env*
!.env.example

# Documentation & Test files
*.md
!README.md
test-*.js
fix_*.sql

# System files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
